# Planned baseline of persite-count-callee-loop-1000: the local property Keep hands F's parameter to a user
# callable, so the supplied range(1, 3) stays an invocation plan. Keep is never read: the executed work is the same.
Pass(v) = v
F(xs) = {
    Keep = Pass(xs)
    count(xs)
}
S(n) = n + F(range(1, 3)) - 2, n < 1000

S(0).while
